sakura-update-center
sakura-store
sakura-store-ui
sddm-kcm

# --- SakuraOS target-system tooling ----------------------------------------
# Present on the live media because the installer drives them. btrfs-progs,
# efibootmgr and archinstall already come from the releng list above.
limine
sbctl
snapper
snap-pac
pacman-contrib
ntfs-3g
os-prober

# ---- everything the installed system has -------------------------------
# The live image is the installed system now: sakura-install copies this
# filesystem onto the disk rather than rebuilding it from packages, so
# anything sakura-desktop declares has to be here or it will not be on the
# machine afterwards.
#
# These two lists drifted apart while nobody was comparing them -- the live
# image was missing thirty-eight of them, including every user-facing
# application and the whole printing stack. Whenever sakura-desktop gains a
# package, it belongs here too.
